==============================================================================================================
  [PASS] (control) C1 CONTROL: membership (CFG212's rule and constants) reproduces CFG212's counts: A963 94 / 8 / 30, A2192 24 / 3 / 8 (members / < 1 Mpc / < 2 Mpc)
