  [PASS] (control) C3 CONTROL: M_HI x (1+z) / (2.356e5 D_L^2 S_int) in [0.99, 1.01] for every galaxy (S_int is in observed-frame velocity units: the frame evidence)
         range 0.9968 to 1.0092
  [PASS] (control) C6 CONTROL (blind loader): the loader returns no width key, and this pre-flight's source contains the width column names nowhere (they live only in cfg260_core's forbidden list)
         keys ['R', 'bmag', 'c', 'cl', 'dl', 'dv', 'e0', 'esint', 'idx', 'inner', 'mem', 'mhi', 'pb', 'ptype', 'rmag', 'sdss', 'sint', 'theta', 'wedge', 'z']; width-like keys []; occurrences of the width column names in this source: 0
  [PASS] (control) C9 CONTROL (Addendum 2 counts, non-width): the completeness-limited sets have the sizes the addendum states (PC 32, PC125 13, PC15 7)
         PC 32, PC125 13, PC15 7

